{"version": 2, "width": 90, "height": 32, "timestamp": 0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "agent-continuity-demo"}
[0.0, "o", "$ ./demo.sh\r\n"]
[0.18, "o", "==================================================================\r\n"]
[0.36, "o", " agent-continuity-demo  \u2014  two agents, one shared memory hub\r\n"]
[0.54, "o", "==================================================================\r\n"]
[0.72, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.9, "o", "[hub] shared memory hub listening on http://127.0.0.1:8787 (db=/tmp/hub.db)\r\n"]
[1.08, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.26, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[1.44, "o", " 1. CROSS-AGENT CONTINUITY\r\n"]
[1.62, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[1.8, "o", "agent-A starts as its own process, writes a fact, then exits.\r\n"]
[1.98, "o", "[agent-A pid=<pid>] wrote fact to hub: project_deadline = 'Friday' (belief_mean=0.90)\r\n"]
[2.16, "o", "(agent-A process has now exited \u2014 its memory is gone, only the hub holds the fact.)\r\n"]
[2.34, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.52, "o", "agent-B starts LATER as a SEPARATE process. It never talked to agent-A.\r\n"]
[2.7, "o", "It reads the shared hub and already knows what agent-A learned:\r\n"]
[2.88, "o", "[agent-B pid=<pid>] read fact from hub (written by a DIFFERENT process): project_deadline = 'Friday'\r\n"]
[3.06, "o", "           -> source recorded in hub: agent-A | belief_mean=0.90\r\n"]
[3.24, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.42, "o", ">> Continuity proven: a fact survived the death of the process that wrote it,\r\n"]
[3.6, "o", "   and a different process picked it up with zero direct handoff.\r\n"]
[3.78, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.96, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[4.14, "o", " 2. BELIEF-CONFLICT CAUGHT (quarantine, not silent overwrite)\r\n"]
[4.32, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[4.5, "o", "An external source now writes a CONFLICTING value for the same fact.\r\n"]
[4.68, "o", "The hub holds 'Friday' with high confidence. The external write says 'Thursday'.\r\n"]
[4.86, "o", "[external-source pid=<pid>] proposed project_deadline = 'Thursday'\r\n"]
[5.04, "o", "[hub] conflict quarantined: project_deadline {agent-A:Friday, external-source:Thursday} -> flagged, not silently overwritten (held_confidence=0.75)\r\n"]
[5.22, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.4, "o", "The hub did NOT overwrite. The held fact is still intact:\r\n"]
[5.58, "o", "[agent-B pid=<pid>] read fact from hub (written by a DIFFERENT process): project_deadline = 'Friday'\r\n"]
[5.76, "o", "           -> source recorded in hub: agent-A | belief_mean=0.75\r\n"]
[5.94, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.12, "o", ">> Conflict caught: the disagreement was recorded and quarantined for review\r\n"]
[6.3, "o", "   instead of silently clobbering the held belief.\r\n"]
[6.48, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.66, "o", "==================================================================\r\n"]
[6.84, "o", " DONE \u2014 both behaviors demonstrated over the real shared hub.\r\n"]
[7.02, "o", "==================================================================\r\n"]
[7.42, "o", "$ \r\n"]
